<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech approves raising capital, share split.</title>
<headline>Czech approves raising capital, share split.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Czech construction company Metrostav a.s. voted on Monday to increase the nominal value of the firm's shares to 1,200 crowns from 1,000 crowns using the company's internal resources, and split each share for 12 100-crown new shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders also approved to pay out a 70 crown gross dividend per one old share on 1996 earnings, the same as in the previous year.</p>
</text>
